@baseUrl = http://localhost:5080

### Baseline: 200, relationships null
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/memberships/1001

### Single expansion: 200
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/memberships/1001?expand=member

### Visits without clubs: 200
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/memberships/1001?expand=visits

### Nested expansion: 200
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/memberships/1001?expand=member,visits.club&relatedLimit=3

### Bounded preview: 200, hasMore true
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/memberships/1001?expand=visits&relatedLimit=1

### Empty collection: 200, data []
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/memberships/1002?expand=visits

### Unsupported relationship: 400
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/memberships/1001?expand=payments

### Excess depth: 400
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/memberships/1001?expand=visits.club.address

### Excess limit: 400
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/memberships/1001?expand=visits&relatedLimit=51

### Missing membership: 404
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/memberships/9999

### Normalized selections: 200
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/memberships/1001?expand=%20MEMBER%20,visits.club,member

### Separate requests (the alternative the benchmark compares against)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/members/1

###
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/memberships/1001/visits?limit=3

###
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/clubs/1
